This project builds on libraries published by the OpenWallet Foundation
(@owf/eudi-tl, @owf/eudi-lote, @owf/eudi-wrprc, @owf/token-status-list), which
are themselves Apache-2.0 licensed. They are consumed as published npm
dependencies and no part of them is redistributed in this repository.

The technical specifications this project implements — ETSI TS 119 612,
TS 119 602, TS 119 475, TS 119 411-8 and the IETF Token Status List draft — are
published by their respective standards bodies and are not distributed here.
Clause numbers and short quotations appear in comments and documentation for
the sole purpose of citing the requirement each piece of code implements.
